&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; line-height: 1; margin-right: 6px; margin-bottom: 2px; text-align: left; text-indent: -42px"&gt;
&lt;img alt="0104010_001.png" src="images/0104010_001.png" style="height: 343.47px; width: 642px"/&gt;
